# Production builds call the same-origin proxy declared in vercel.json
# (/api/* -> https://nfl-prediction-backend.onrender.com/*), so the browser never
# makes a cross-origin request and no CORS allowlist can block it. That removes
# the failure where the deployed site reported the backend as "not responding"
# on Vercel preview URLs and other aliases the backend's allowlist did not name.
#
# Nothing needs to be set here. To bypass the proxy on purpose and call an
# absolute backend URL directly, set VITE_API_DIRECT_URL instead (see
# src/utils/apiBase.js). VITE_API_URL only affects development builds.

